{"node_id": "nd005", "text": "feels sadness", "depth": 0, "parent_id": null, "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.95, "confidence_raw": 0.95, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things have been tough. Work still feels uncertain, and I miss my friend a lot.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 79}, {"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It’s draining.", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 155}, {"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "I guess I just need to find some routine, something stable. But it’s hard when everything feels so up in the air.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 113}, {"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things feel heavy still. Every day just drags on. Not sure how to get back on track.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 84}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261008T041723Z", "last_updated_at": "20261008T042206Z", "first_seen_session": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "last_session": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 2}
{"node_id": "nd006", "text": "To feel supported", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd005", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.7, "confidence_raw": 0.7, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things have been tough.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "my mind keeps drifting back to her", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 139}, {"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I know it’s okay to miss her, but it feels like there’s nothing I can do to make it better.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 91}, {"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I know it’s okay to miss her, but it feels like there’s nothing I can do to make it better. The uncertainty at work doesn’t help either.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 136}, {"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It’s hard to find motivation. I’ve tried setting goals but they just get pushed aside.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 86}, {"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I just push them off.", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 85}, {"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "I feel like I’m barely moving forward.", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 120}, {"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "But sometimes even tiny steps feel too big. I feel like I’m barely moving forward.", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 120}, {"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "Making my bed feels like such a small task, but it's hard to even start sometimes. Pushing myself to drink water first thing is also daunting.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 142}, {"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "That feels like too little, though. I worry that even a minute will be too much. What if I fail?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 96}, {"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 17, "quote": "That feels like a lot to expect from myself right now. I worry I won't even manage a minute. Maybe I'll just try to breathe deeply for a minute instead.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 152}, {"session_id": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 19, "quote": "That feels manageable. I'll try to focus on just one minute of deep breathing to start.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 87}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261008T041723Z", "last_updated_at": "20261008T042206Z", "first_seen_session": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "last_session": "p000111-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 2}
